# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
Name:           libclass-meta-perl
Version:        0.66
Release:        1%{?dist}
Summary:        Create typed Perl classes with metadata and introspection
License:        GPL-1.0-or-later OR Artistic-1.0-Perl
URL:            https://metacpan.org/dist/Class-Meta
Source0:        Class-Meta-%{version}.tar.gz
Source1:        Artistic-1.0-Perl.txt
Source2:        GPL-1.0.txt
BuildArch:      noarch
BuildRequires:  make
BuildRequires:  perl
BuildRequires:  perl-generators
BuildRequires:  perl(ExtUtils::MakeMaker)
BuildRequires:  perl(Module::Build)
BuildRequires:  perl(Class::ISA) >= 0.35
BuildRequires:  perl(Data::Types) >= 0.05
BuildRequires:  perl(Test::More)
BuildRequires:  perl(Test::Pod) >= 1.41
BuildRequires:  perl(Test::Pod::Coverage) >= 0.08
Requires:       perl
Requires:       perl(Class::ISA) >= 0.35
Requires:       perl(Data::Types) >= 0.05

%description
Class::Meta creates Perl classes with typed attributes, constructors,
accessors, and runtime introspection.

%prep
%autosetup -n Class-Meta-%{version} -p1

%build
%{__perl} Makefile.PL INSTALLDIRS=vendor NO_PACKLIST=1 NO_PERLLOCAL=1
%make_build

%install
make pure_install DESTDIR=%{buildroot}
install -pm0644 %{SOURCE1} Artistic-1.0-Perl.txt
install -pm0644 %{SOURCE2} GPL-1.0.txt
cat > Module-Build-Compat-NOTICE.txt <<'NOTICE'
The archived Class::Meta Makefile.PL was generated by the traditional
template in Module::Build::Compat 0.40 (Module-Build-0.40.tar.gz).

Copyright (c) 2001-2006 Ken Williams.  All rights reserved.

This library is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
modify it under the same terms as Perl itself.
NOTICE

%check
make test TEST_VERBOSE=1

%files
%license README.md Artistic-1.0-Perl.txt GPL-1.0.txt Module-Build-Compat-NOTICE.txt
%doc Changes
%{perl_vendorlib}/Class/Meta.pm
%{perl_vendorlib}/Class/Meta/
%{_mandir}/man3/Class::Meta.3pm*
%{_mandir}/man3/Class::Meta::*.3pm*

%changelog
* Sun Nov 08 2026 openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid> - 0.66-1
- Package the fixed upstream release with unchanged default tests and notices.
